  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業法律環境",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS ENVIRONMENT AND LAW",
    "describe_ch": "歐美國家商管學院教授，強調法律在工商社會重要性、提倡學生應多研習法律，形成普遍性常識。著重在財經法律、土地法規、稅法、勞工法規、財產權、契約等法律，對於商業經營有重要影響。",
    "describe_eh": "Professor of the Business School of European and American countries emphasized the importance of law in the business society and advocated that students should study more law. Although it is impossible to get involved in understanding, it should have general common sense. It focuses on financial laws, land laws, tax laws, labor laws, property rights, contracts and other laws, which have an important impact on business operations.",
